          <p class="sp-p">Each mosaic masterpiece is custom-made, so the handling time is up to <strong>4–5 weeks</strong>, with transit then taking around 10 days. On a tight deadline? Expedited delivery is available for an additional fee and can shorten processing by up to 2 weeks.</p>
          <div class="sp-callout">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2B7BE8" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M13 2 3 14h7l-1 8 10-12h-7z"/></svg>
            <span>For expedited delivery details, email us at <a href="mailto:info@imosaicart.com">info@imosaicart.com</a>.</span>
          </div>
        </div>

